Modifications (allowed by the OFL; the copyright line in OFL.txt declares no Reserved Font Name):
  - weight axis limited to 400-700 (fontTools.varLib.instancer)
  - subset by script (fontTools.subset), hinting removed, OpenType features kept: tnum pnum case ccmp locl calt
    ss01 ss02 kern liga
  - compressed to WOFF2
