Why Onest (glyph coverage measured with fontTools on the shipped files, see apps/web/src/fonts.test.ts)
  Needed for Uzbek Latin: o‘ g‘ (U+2018), the modifier apostrophes U+02BB (ʻ) and U+02BC (ʼ), U+2019 (’),
  U+0027, plus S/Ch/Sh/ng built from plain Latin letters.
  Onest        : all present (only the rarely used U+02B9 and U+02BF are absent). Cyrillic and Uzbek Cyrillic complete.
  Geologica    : U+02BB and U+02BF missing, so oʻ gʻ with the official modifier letter would fall back to another font.
  Manrope      : U+02BB, U+02BC, U+02B9, U+02BF missing and no Uzbek Cyrillic letters (Қ Ғ Ҳ).
